**Visual function**
Note actor.rig.root.scale set to height/1.95; when we set root.position.y each frame we shouldn't overwrite scale. Position y bob.

Facing: set rotation y toward hoop/man. For active face hoop. For away: `d.man` maybe, else nearest home. Compute target:
