if(state.rebound){ ball...}
else if(a.team==='home'){ hoop...}
else { const man=a.man||active; fx=man.x-a.x; fz=man.z-a.z}
const target = Math.atan2(-fx,-fz)
```
For home off-ball, face hoop. Could face ball if receiving pass; okay.

Arms:
- Identify isActive = a===activeActor() && a.team==='home'.
- Home active:
  - raise = charging? charge : shootAnim; arms as before with two hands up.
  - Ball dribble: right arm slightly down and oscillate? Set when not raise: right shoulder x=0.2+sin(t*6)*.15; left 0.2.
  - If pass? not active? active is passer until catch; ball in flight; active still. Keep.
- Home off-ball:
  - running arms swing opposite legs; if cutting, arms pumping; if receive, hands up.
  - if screen screener, arms out wide (z rotations ±1.3, x .1) and knees bent (hip -0.25, knee .4).
- Away:
  - contest factor: if state.shot flight or nearest dist to active<2.2 => arms up. Set both shoulders x 2.4.
  - if stunned, arms flail z.
