- EndGame while shot mid-flight: overlay; ball frozen. Fine.
- During paused, updateEffects continues? netPulse decays; fine; poses maybe freeze. We can pose actors always (except paused?) but pose with dt would animate legs even when paused (velocities remain, no movement). It might look alive. Fine.
