- `ui.onball` initial set to first home star only when teams built; but HUD hidden in menu. fine.

**Initial scene**:
At module eval, the select overlay is hidden, main overlay visible. Default teams built and visible behind overlay. Great.

**Potential naming conflicts**:
- `clock` is now declared in state section. Base file did not have clock (cut before). Yes, base only arena. Good.
